COMMERCIAL S11.2-R15.1 OPTIONAL EVIDENCE GLOB DIAGNOSIS

Date: 2026-09-23
Status: ROOT_CAUSE_CONFIRMED; AUTOMATIC_ROLLBACK_GREEN; R15_2_FIX_AUTHORIZED

Observed deployment result

- The exact r3 freeze passed canonical preflight and created a fresh verified
  root-owned mode-0700 backup at
  `/opt/tu1nz_repos/backups/commercial-s11-2-canary-bootstrap/20260923T191321Z-predeploy`.
- The R15.1 local PostgreSQL-administrator history readback succeeded.
- The terminal epoch was archived and rearmed without deleting or mutating
